ghostchat (1.0.0) unstable; urgency=low

  * Initial release.
  * X25519 ECDH + AES-256-GCM encrypted P2P terminal chat.
  * Curses TUI with split-pane layout and colour-coded messages.
  * Optional passphrase gate via Scrypt + HMAC-SHA256.
  * In-chat commands: /quit, /clear, /burn, /whoami, /ping.
  * Zero disk writes — fully ephemeral session.

 -- ghostchat maintainer <ghostchat@example.com>  Thu, 01 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000
